---
const principles = [
  {
    title: "Keep it running",
    description: "Software that works in production beats software that works in demos. I focus on reliability over novelty.",
  },
  {
    title: "Learn by doing",
    description: "New tech stack at a client? Give me a sprint. I pick things up fast because I actually build with them.",
  },
  {
    title: "Plain language",
    description: "If I can't explain what I built to a non-developer, I probably built it wrong.",
  },
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 px-6 border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-rust font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          About
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-ink leading-tight mb-6">
          Java and DevOps,<br />mostly.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-ink-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I am Steven Fourie. I have been writing Java professionally since 2011 and have worked across healthcare, government, automotive, and e-commerce. Most of my work involves Spring Boot, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
          I moved from South Africa to the Netherlands in 2025. Before that, I led teams at a warehousing company and built backend systems for public healthcare. Now I work on citizen services software at Pinkroccade.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-rust font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          How I work
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          {principles.map((p) => (
            <div class="border-l-2 border-rust pl-6">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">
                {p.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
                {p.description}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
